{"version": 2, "width": 100, "height": 34, "title": "n8n Invoice Review \u2014 edited-paced replay of actual outputs", "env": {"TERM": "xterm-256color"}}
[0, "o", "\u001b[2J\u001b[Hn8n Invoice Review\r\nWhat this project demonstrates\r\n\r\nn8n submits an invoice into a durable review queue. Vendor plus invoice number detect duplicates. Integer cents validate totals. A separate explicit operator approval archives the invoice transactionally.\r\n"]
[10, "o", "\u001b[2J\u001b[Hn8n Invoice Review\r\nActual fixture demo output\r\n\r\n{\r\n  \"mode\": \"fixture\",\r\n  \"python\": \"3.12.13\",\r\n  \"recorded_at\": \"2026-10-31T13:52:19.950870+00:00\",\r\n  \"elapsed_seconds\": 0.02,\r\n  \"result\": {\r\n    \"duplicate_same_id\": true,\r\n    \"bad\": {\r\n      \"id\": \"fbfd3b05-1cec-4c3d-8937-fe183388ea5e\",\r\n      \"invoice\": {\r\n        \"number\": \"DEMO-43\",\r\n        \"vendor\": \"Example Ltd\",\r\n        \"subtotal_cents\": 10000,\r\n        \"tax_cents\": 2100,\r\n        \"total_cents\": 99999\r\n      },\r\n      \"fingerprint\": \"685966ed7e858254c2081506eefe1b7a2c8cd1c5da942ebdf86617c50ceaf87e\",\r\n      \"status\": \"needs_correction\",\r\n      \"issues\": [\r\n        \"total mismatch\"\r\n      ],\r\n      \"reviewer\": null\r\n    },\r\n    \"archive\": [\r\n      {\r\n        \"number\": \"DEMO-42\",\r\n        \"vendor\": \"Example Ltd\",\r\n        \"subtotal_cents\": 10000,\r\n        \"tax_cents\": 2100,\r\n        \"total_cents\": 12100\r\n      }\r\n    ]\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n"]
